1
00:00:01,401 --> 00:00:05,912
Local dashboard backup demo. Synthetic family and simulated decisions; no money is sent.

2
00:00:05,912 --> 00:00:10,713
A gift-card request pauses after ATM cash. The family sees both steps and the times.

3
00:00:10,713 --> 00:00:15,308
Deny stops the request and announces the result.

4
00:00:15,308 --> 00:00:20,125
A payment requiring two approvers stays waiting after the first yes.

5
00:00:20,125 --> 00:00:24,792
This simulated single-approval request changes to Approved.

6
00:00:24,792 --> 00:00:29,405
An unanswered request expires and is blocked.

7
00:00:29,405 --> 00:00:34,040
When Guardian is required, the dashboard offers Deny and directs approval to the enrolled phone.
